{"4940330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Derby Heroines: Run, Bet, Win!", "steam_appid": 4940330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Bet. Win!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Derby Heroines </i>brings the full grammar of horse racing to a track-and-field girls' racing game. Study the paddock, read the odds, buy your tickets — then take the starting gate yourself. Bet on yourself and cash in with your own two feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▍Races are action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your dash gauge, grab skill orbs on the track, and unleash your once-per-race special move. Pack running, slipstreams, photo finishes — with a live tracking board and full race commentary in four languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras/7a2585181483abccead77d52206d9951.avif?t=1786632363\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras_big/7a2585181483abccead77d52206d9951.avif?t=1786632363 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▍A real betting system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven bet types — Win, Place, Quinella Place, Quinella, Exacta, Trio, Trifecta — plus wheel, box and formation betting. Odds are simulated per race, so favorites and long shots actually make sense. Every bet uses in-game currency only. No real money, ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras/a749c2e6fd03059a0a9f1a8978e01252.avif?t=1786632363\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras_big/a749c2e6fd03059a0a9f1a8978e01252.avif?t=1786632363 width=1560 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▍PINZUDO 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the winner of five straight races (R7–R11) for a jackpot-style payout with carryover. Hit all five and get rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▍Collect &amp; train</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit 100+ track girls via gacha — many with gloriously silly racehorse-style names. Check distance aptitude and running style, pick your entry, and level her up with race XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras/4c51412554dd72dc96d2bf65597a36ed.poster.avif?t=1786632363\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras/4c51412554dd72dc96d2bf65597a36ed.webm?t=1786632363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4940330/extras/4c51412554dd72dc96d2bf65597a36ed.mp4?t=1786632363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▍Supported languages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI &amp; commentary: Japanese / English / Traditional Chinese / French</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >▍Streaming &amp; video policy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming, videos and monetization are <strong>welcome without prior permission</strong>, for individuals and companies alike. No spoiler restrictions. Clips, thumbnails and screenshots are all fine. Perfect for &quot;pick the winner with your chat&quot; streams!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Bet. Win!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Derby Heroines </i>brings the full grammar of horse racing to a track-and-field girls' racing game. Study the paddock, read the odds, buy your tickets — then take the starting gate yourself. Bet on yourself and cash in with your ow